{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f0f10;--card:#0b0b0c;--muted:#9aa1a6;--accent:#7fb77e;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);--maxw:1100px}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#e6efea;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071012 0%,#081516 40%),#03110f}
    a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:24px;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a6b5a, #0ea884);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(5,80,65,0.2)}
    .logo svg{width:36px;height:36px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;font-size:15px}
    nav a{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a[href$="contact.html"]{background:var(--glass)}

    main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:28px auto;padding:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:14px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,10,10,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .hero{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center}
    .hero .copy{flex:1}
    h1{margin:0;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.2px;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0}

    /* Pattern background using inline-data SVG */
    .pattern-wrap{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.06}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:grid;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:#eaf6ed}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .cta{display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#5db37c);color:#04221a;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer}

    /* Sidebar widgets */
    .widget{margin-bottom:18px}
    .meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Timeline planner */
    .timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .phase{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent)}
    .phase .dot{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#123827,#0b5740);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#dff6e9;font-weight:700}
    .phase .body{flex:1}
    .phase .range{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .phase input[type=range]{width:170px}
    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:#b9c7c1;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}

    /* Proof Gallery */
    .proof{display:grid;gap:12px}
    .testimonial{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#e8f6ee}
    .who{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
    .badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}
    .tip{position:fixed;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:28px;background:#04120f;color:#cfece0;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);display:none}

    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:28px auto;padding:16px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media(max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}header{padding:18px} .logo{width:48px;height:48px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="pattern-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
    <!-- unique inline SVG pattern (serves as assets/img/pattern.svg alternative) -->
    <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="p1" x="0" y="0" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <rect width="40" height="40" fill="#02100f" />
          <path d="M0 30 L10 20 L20 30 L30 20 L40 30" stroke="#073732" stroke-opacity="0.6" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none" />
          <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1.3" fill="#0aa37f" fill-opacity="0.18" />
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect x="6" y="6" width="52" height="52" rx="10" fill="url(#g)" />
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#0a6b5a" />
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#0ea884" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <g fill="none" stroke="#e8f6ee" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M20 36c4-8 12-12 20-12" stroke-linecap="round" />
            <path d="M18 44c6-6 22-6 28 0" stroke-linecap="round" />
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Ailments</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="panel hero" aria-labelledby="contact-hero">
      <div class="copy">
        <h1 id="contact-hero">Begin a careful experiment in balanced living</h1>
        <p class="lead">Reach out for a short conversation to map what matters, clarify priorities, and co-design a modest plan you can actually try. We collect history, context, and routine — then propose gentle, evidence-aware steps.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
          <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside style="width:340px">
        <div class="panel widget">
          <div class="meta"><div class="small">Quick contact</div><div class="small">Response within 48–72 hrs</div></div>
          <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return false;">
            <label>Name
              <input id="name" placeholder="Your name" aria-label="Name" required />
            </label>
            <label>Email
              <input id="email" placeholder="you@domain.tld" aria-label="Email" required />
            </label>
            <label>How can we help?
              <textarea id="message" placeholder="A short note about what you hope to address" aria-label="Message"></textarea>
            </label>
            <button class="cta" id="sendBtn">Send inquiry</button>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer phone? Leave a number and best times to call.</div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="timeline">
      <h2 id="timeline" style="margin-top:0">Roadmap planner — three phases</h2>
      <p class="small">Use the sliders to sketch a timeline. This is educational and planning-oriented — not a promise of outcomes. Clinical decisions require direct assessment.</p>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="phase">
          <div class="dot">1</div>
          <div class="body">
            <div style="font-weight:600">Phase one — Baseline & gentle resets</div>
            <div class="small">Weeks focused on assessment, sleep, hydration, and simple routines.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="range">
            <input type="range" min="1" max="8" value="3" data-phase="1" />
            <div class="small weeks" data-for="1">3 wk</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="phase">
          <div class="dot">2</div>
          <div class="body">
            <div style="font-weight:600">Phase two — Introduce cycles</div>
            <div class="small">Titrate nutrition, movement, and coping strategies with measured changes.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="range">
            <input type="range" min="2" max="16" value="6" data-phase="2" />
            <div class="small weeks" data-for="2">6 wk</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="phase">
          <div class="dot">3</div>
          <div class="body">
            <div style="font-weight:600">Phase three — Sustain & adapt</div>
            <div class="small">Build habits, troubleshoot plateaus, and design maintenance rhythms.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="range">
            <input type="range" min="4" max="52" value="12" data-phase="3" />
            <div class="small weeks" data-for="3">12 wk</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="disclaimer">
          Note: This timeline is a planning tool. It does not replace diagnosis or treatment from a licensed clinician. Adjust pacing for personal needs and medical considerations.
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600">Estimated total</div>
            <div id="totalWeeks" style="font-size:20px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700">21 weeks</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <button class="cta" id="exportPlan">Export sketch</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside>
      <div class="panel widget">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Proof Gallery</h3>
        <div class="proof">
          <div class="testimonial" id="testimonial">
            <div class="quote">"I've learned gentle habits that stack — small moves that quietly changed my energy."</div>
            <div class="who">— A former client, mid-40s</div>
            <div class="badges" id="badges">
              <div class="badge" data-tip="Board-certified clinician oversight">Board-aligned</div>
              <div class="badge" data-tip="Published case summaries & community talks">Local talks</div>
              <div class="badge" data-tip="Client-vetted protocols & anonymized outcomes">Practice log</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button id="prevT" style="flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px">Prev</button>
            <button id="nextT" style="flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px">Next</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel widget">
        <h4 style="margin-top:0">Small habits to try</h4>
        <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)">
          <li>Start with 10 minutes of consistent wake time window.</li>
          <li>Two-minute evening wind-down (no screens, one breath exercise).</li>
          <li>One weekly check-in: write three small wins.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="panel widget">
        <h4 style="margin-top:0">Programs & investment</h4>
        <div style="font-weight:600">Foundations Cycle — starting at $350</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0">A focused 6–12 week plan to stabilise routines and collect useful data.</div>
        <div style="font-weight:600;margin-top:8px">Renewal Sequence — from $850</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0">Multi-phase coordination for more complex goals and sustained habit change.</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px">Sliding scale / payment plans available. Details discussed during initial consult.</div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <div class="tip" id="badgeTip" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

  <footer>
    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
    <div style="margin-top:8px">Educational resources and planning tools only — not medical advice. For urgent concerns, contact emergency services or your local clinician.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Timeline planner logic
    (function(){
      const ranges = document.querySelectorAll('input[type=range]');
      const total = document.getElementById('totalWeeks');
      function updateTotals(){
        let sum=0; ranges.forEach(r=>sum+=parseInt(r.value,10));
        total.textContent = sum + ' weeks';
        ranges.forEach(r=>{
          const lbl = document.querySelector('.weeks[data-for="'+r.dataset.phase+'"]');
          if(lbl) lbl.textContent = r.value + ' wk';
        });
      }
      ranges.forEach(r=>r.addEventListener('input',updateTotals));
      updateTotals();

      document.getElementById('exportPlan').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const data = {phase1:parseInt(document.querySelector('input[data-phase="1"]').value,10),phase2:parseInt(document.querySelector('input[data-phase="2"]').value,10),phase3:parseInt(document.querySelector('input[data-phase="3"]').value,10)};
        const txt = 'Roadmap sketch — Phase 1: '+data.phase1+' wk, Phase 2: '+data.phase2+' wk, Phase 3: '+data.phase3+' wk.';
        navigator.clipboard?.writeText(txt).then(()=>{
          alert('Plan copied to clipboard:\n'+txt+'\n\nRemember: this is a planning tool, not clinical guidance.');
        }, ()=>{
          alert(txt+'\n\n(Clipboard not available)');
        });
      });
    })();

    // Proof Gallery rotation + badges with tooltips
    (function(){
      const testimonials = [
        {quote:'"Small, steady shifts made my energy less erratic over months."', who:'— Client, age 37'},
        {quote:'"We focused on rhythm and small wins; my sleep improved without harsh changes."', who:'— Client, age 51'},
        {quote:'"The plan respected my life; it felt like a sensible experiment, not a mandate."', who:'— Client, age 29'}
      ];
      let idx=0; const tEl = document.getElementById('testimonial');
      function render(){
        const q = testimonials[idx];
        tEl.querySelector('.quote').textContent = q.quote;
        tEl.querySelector('.who').textContent = q.who;
      }
      document.getElementById('nextT').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ idx=(idx+1)%testimonials.length; render(); });
      document.getElementById('prevT').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ idx=(idx-1+testimonials.length)%testimonials.length; render(); });
      setInterval(()=>{ idx=(idx+1)%testimonials.length; render(); },5000);
      render();

      const badges = document.querySelectorAll('.badge');
      const tip = document.getElementById('badgeTip');
      badges.forEach(b=>{
        b.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>{
          tip.textContent = b.dataset.tip || '';
          tip.style.display = 'block';
        });
        b.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{ tip.style.display = 'none'; });
        b.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          tip.textContent = b.dataset.tip || '';
          tip.style.display = 'block';
          setTimeout(()=>tip.style.display='none',3000);
        });
      });
    })();

    // Simple contact handling (mock)
    (function(){
      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      const send = document.getElementById('sendBtn');
      send.addEventListener('click', async (e)=>{
        e.preventDefault();
        const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
        const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
        const msg = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
        if(!name||!email){ alert('Please provide name and email.'); return; }
        send.textContent = 'Sending…'; send.disabled=true;
        await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,600));
        alert('Thanks, '+name+'. Your note was recorded. We will reply to '+email+' within 48–72 hours.');
        send.textContent = 'Send inquiry'; send.disabled=false; form.reset();
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and notes for chunk: holistic_medicine-MORE-2026-02-17T20-38-51-126Z-033

What is included
- contact.html — a standalone contact + planning page for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}.

Purpose and features
- Minimal, poetic interface tuned for holistic / integrative medicine practices.
- Interactive timeline planner (three phases) with sliders to sketch a roadmap and an "Export sketch" action that copies a short summary to the clipboard. Includes a clear disclaimer about clinical decisions.
- Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials with Prev/Next controls and credibility badges. Badges show short tooltips on hover and click.
- Contact form (mock) that validates minimal fields and simulates sending a request; suitable to wire into server endpoints later.
- Sidebar micro-habits, program names, and pricing framing designed to differ from other templates.

Design notes
- No external assets or CDNs are used. A bespoke inline SVG pattern provides visual texture (serves as the pattern that would otherwise live at assets/img/pattern.svg).
- The page uses a compact, two-column layout on wide screens and stacks on small screens.
- Navigation uses a distinct label set: Start, Offerings, Ailments, Method, Investment, About, Book, Connect — linking to the correct filenames.

Accessibility & compliance
- The planner and gallery include accessible labels and live-region updates for small interactions.
- Disclaimers are present: the planner is explicitly a planning tool and not medical advice.

Integration
- Replace placeholders: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.
- To connect the contact form to a backend: attach a submit handler to contactForm that performs a POST to your endpoint and handle success/error accordingly.

Notes for maintainers
- The inline SVG pattern is intentionally unique. If you prefer a separate file, extract the <svg> content into assets/img/pattern.svg and update .pattern-wrap to reference it as a background image.
- The testimonial rotation and badge tooltips are simple and light; consider replacing alert() with UI to show form submission confirmations for production.

